#: ../../identity-provider.rst:131
msgid ""
"The URLs use the defaults of the Keycloak app: the host ``ucs-sso-"
"ng.DOMAIN`` and the realm ``ucs``, which holds the users of the domain. "
"If you changed :external+uv-keycloak-"
